# The seventh battle (stage 6, SCENE8) ended by the harness, not played: a
# made save for the chain's next link. From the original's save after stage 5,
# the battle played until 07:30, then the lance sent east past the Dragon's
# guard; at a quiet moment before contact the Dragon (unit 20) is destroyed
# by destroy:20, the game's own path for a unit's end. The scene's own ending
# runs from there (its check that no lance unit is under fire, result 2):
# the transmission after it, then Save & Continue to slot 1. No original
# trace can match this one; the save it writes is REVENGE_SAVE_STAGE_06.
# set: campaign
# start-save: REVENGE_SAVE_STAGE_05
# Load Game, slot 1; the battle running.
idle:1000 Return idle:50 Right idle:50 Return idle:300
Return steps:2 @snap:stage6_battle
# The messages at 07:16 and 07:28, the ally's arrival at 07:30 and its loss.
still:2000 @snap:stage6_message1 Return
still:2000 @snap:stage6_message2 Return
still:2000 @snap:stage6_ally Return
still:2000 @snap:stage6_ally_lost Return
# Lance Commands, Move: the cursor 39 cells up and right, then 50 up, to the
# east of the guard's two groups; the order given.
steps:10 Return idle:300 Return idle:300
PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 PageUp idle:20 
Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 Up idle:20 
idle:100 @snap:stage6_cursor Return idle:300 Return idle:300 Return steps:1 @snap:stage6_ordered
# 150 steps on, no contact yet (07:33:57): the Dragon destroyed.
steps:150 @snap:stage6_before steps:1 destroy:20
# The battle won at once (07:34); the transmission after it, each screen
# answered.
still:2000 @snap:stage6_won Return idle:300
still:2000 @snap:stage6_after1 Return idle:300
still:2000 @snap:stage6_after2 Return idle:300
# The menu over it: Save & Continue to slot 1, as stage_05 does.
still:2000 @snap:stage6_menu
Down idle:50 Down idle:50 @snap:stage6_save
Return idle:300 @snap:stage6_slots
Return idle:300 @snap:stage6_save1 Return idle:300 @snap:stage6_save2
# Saved; stage 7 starts at once, its battle running: its fourth step.
Return steps:4 @snap:stage6_saved
